  "description": "A comprehensive .NET framework following Clean Architecture principles with JWT authentication, CQRS, caching, rate limiting, health checks, messaging infrastructure (RabbitMQ+MassTransit, Kafka), multi-tenancy, outbox/inbox patterns, HTTP idempotency, OpenTelemetry observability, Saga/Process Manager, MongoDB projections, FluentValidation pipeline, enhanced Swagger/OpenAPI, localization, money value objects, domain events, search abstractions, storage abstraction, security hardening, auditing, background jobs, configuration management, and DevEx tools.",
